  "description": "The woman in the pink dress vanished, leaving behind an intense, unforgettable night. \n\nFor a year, Baek-ju pined for her, the one who took his cherished purity and disappeared. \n\nJust like that sudden night, Yu-young reappeared before him in broad daylight. With an innocent face, as if seeing him for the first time, she became his new secretary. \n\nHowever, the photograph Yu-young always carries around is deeply suspicious. \n\n'Wait, this child looks exactly like me?' It seems he has discovered the secret she tried to hide.\n\n[Original Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=13256100) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=854412), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14659741)",
